#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:107
msgid "Logback (File-based)"
msgstr "Logback (baseado em arquivo)"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:109
msgid ""
"Audit events are logged through the standard Logback framework under the "
"``com.morpheus.AuditLogService`` logger. By default, these go to the main"
" application log. For a dedicated audit log file, add a rolling file "
"appender to ``logback.xml``:"
msgstr "Os eventos de auditoria são registrados pelo framework Logback padrão no logger ``com.morpheus.AuditLogService``. Por padrão, eles vão para o log principal da aplicação. Para um arquivo de log de auditoria dedicado, adicione um appender de arquivo com rotação ao ``logback.xml``:"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:111
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"<appender name=\"AUDIT_FILE\" "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.RollingFileAppender\">\n"
"    <file>/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/audit.log</file>\n"
"    <rollingPolicy "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.TimeBasedRollingPolicy\">\n"
"        <fileNamePattern>/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/audit.%d{yyyy-MM-"
"dd}.log</fileNamePattern>\n"
"        <maxHistory>365</maxHistory>\n"
"    </rollingPolicy>\n"
"    <encoder>\n"
"        <pattern>%date %msg%n</pattern>\n"
"    </encoder>\n"
"</appender>\n"
"\n"
"<logger name=\"com.morpheus.AuditLogService\" level=\"INFO\" "
"additivity=\"false\">\n"
"    <appender-ref ref=\"AUDIT_FILE\" />\n"
"</logger>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:128
msgid ""
"This provides a file-based audit trail that can be retained longer than "
"the 90-day database purge and forwarded via OS-level syslog."
msgstr "Isso fornece uma trilha de auditoria baseada em arquivo que pode ser retida por mais tempo que o expurgo de 90 dias do banco de dados e encaminhada via syslog em nível de SO."

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:131
msgid "SIEM / External Forwarding"
msgstr "SIEM / Encaminhamento Externo"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:133
msgid ""
"Because audit events use CEF format natively, they can be forwarded "
"directly to SIEM platforms:"
msgstr "Como os eventos de auditoria usam o formato CEF nativamente, eles podem ser encaminhados diretamente para plataformas SIEM:"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:135
msgid "**ArcSight** — CEF is the native format"
msgstr "**ArcSight** — CEF é o formato nativo"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:136
msgid "**Splunk** — Use the Splunk CEF Add-on for parsing"
msgstr "**Splunk** — Use o Splunk CEF Add-on para análise"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:137
msgid "**IBM QRadar** — Supports CEF log source type"
msgstr "**IBM QRadar** — Oferece suporte ao tipo de origem de log CEF"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:138
msgid ""
"**Any syslog-compatible SIEM** — Forward the audit log file via rsyslog"
"/syslog-ng"
msgstr "**Qualquer SIEM compatível com syslog** — Encaminhe o arquivo de log de auditoria via rsyslog/syslog-ng"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:140
msgid ""
"To forward audit events to a SIEM via syslog, configure a syslog appender"
" in ``logback.xml``:"
msgstr "Para encaminhar eventos de auditoria para um SIEM via syslog, configure um appender syslog em ``logback.xml``:"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:142
msgid ""
"<appender name=\"SIEM_SYSLOG\" "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.classic.net.SyslogAppender\">\n"
"    <syslogHost>your-siem-host</syslogHost>\n"
"    <port>6514</port>\n"
"    <facility>AUTH</facility>\n"
"    <suffixPattern>%msg</suffixPattern>\n"
"</appender>\n"
"\n"
"<logger name=\"com.morpheus.AuditLogService\" level=\"INFO\" "
"additivity=\"true\">\n"
"    <appender-ref ref=\"SIEM_SYSLOG\" />\n"
"</logger>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:156
msgid "Tamper Detection"
msgstr "Detecção de Adulteração"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:158
msgid ""
"Each audit log entry includes a ``logSignature`` field — a **SHA-256 "
"hash** of the full CEF description. This allows security teams to verify "
"that audit records have not been modified after creation:"
msgstr "Cada entrada de log de auditoria inclui um campo ``logSignature`` — um **hash SHA-256** da descrição CEF completa. Isso permite que equipes de segurança verifiquem se os registros de auditoria não foram modificados após a criação:"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:160
msgid ""
"Compare the stored hash against a recalculated hash of the description "
"field"
msgstr "Compare o hash armazenado com um hash recalculado do campo de descrição"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:161
msgid "Any discrepancy indicates the record has been tampered with"
msgstr "Qualquer discrepância indica que o registro foi adulterado"

#: ../../administration/logging/audit_logging.rst:162
msgid ""
"This satisfies NIST 800-53 AU-9 (Protection of Audit Information) and "
"AU-10 (Non-repudiation)"
